"""Видео (io.github.haltia_de.Video): videos in touch-sized cards, played
full screen by haltia-vplay (built from vplay/ in this repository), mpv elsewhere.
A GTK 3 program of its own: its questions are haltia-kit's in-window
dialogs; a desktop's theme gives the look (the Haltia tablet shell's theme
makes the header and dialogs large, and its touch filter buzzes).

Four pages under the search field: Главная (what is new in the followed
channels, then what each source finds popular or picks for the account;
it opens first), Новое (the newest videos of the followed channels, all
together), Каналы (those channels with their avatar, subscribers and
latest video; a tap shows one, the cross unfollows; a field above them
finds new channels) and История (what was played). A search shows its
results in place of the page. A tap on a card plays the video; a long
press follows or unfollows its channel.

Where the videos come from is a set of sources (the sources package next
to this file, or /usr/lib/haltia-video/sources): YouTube and VK Видео
now, others the same way. Настройки (the gear) switches them on and off
and signs in to them. A search goes to every source switched on, YouTube's
results first; the button left of the field narrows it to one.

Followed channels and settings are kept in ~/.config/haltia-video/video.json,
the history in ~/.local/share/haltia-video/history.json; card pictures, the
last feed and Главная in ~/.cache/haltia-video/ (moved there from the b8k
places of 1.x at the first start, renamed.py), so that a start shows them at
once and fetches what is new behind them.
"""
